WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.048
<v><b>Kirsty Leanne:</b></v> So, this happened some years ago. I was 19,

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:12.089
and that summer I ended a relationship with my boyfriend.

00:00:12.729 --> 00:00:18.198
I wanted to travel as far away as possible, but I needed to get a job!

00:00:19.062 --> 00:00:23.763
I was lucky to find temporary work as a receptionist in California,

00:00:24.164 --> 00:00:29.461
so I booked my flights with a travel agent. I was really excited.

00:00:30.742 --> 00:00:34.581
A few weeks later, just five days before my flight,

00:00:34.678 --> 00:00:36.756
I checked all my travel documents.

00:00:37.439 --> 00:00:39.788
Suddenly, I noticed a mistake.

00:00:40.389 --> 00:00:51.143
My name on the flight booking was Leanna, L-E-A-N-N-A, not Leanne, L-E-A-N-N-E.

00:00:51.994 --> 00:00:56.126
Just one small typo, but a very big mistake, because of course,

00:00:56.682 --> 00:01:03.004
the name on my ID was Leanne, and I was sure that was a problem.

00:01:03.644 --> 00:01:09.116
I immediately called the travel agent and asked them to change the name on the ticket.

00:01:09.868 --> 00:01:13.572
They weren’t stressed at all and suggested a solution.

00:01:14.245 --> 00:01:20.005
“Don’t worry. We can cancel your ticket and then book you a new one for the same flight.”

00:01:20.905 --> 00:01:24.740
It was expensive, but I decided to do it.

00:01:25.879 --> 00:01:28.029
When I arrived at the check-in desk,

00:01:28.214 --> 00:01:35.219
I showed my ID to the assistant, but my name wasn’t on the flight! I started to panic.

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:40.386
I called the travel agent, and they discovered that it was their mistake.

00:01:41.153 --> 00:01:43.353
They talked to the woman at the check-in.

00:01:43.954 --> 00:01:50.198
I waited…and I waited… Finally, she handed me my boarding pass.

00:01:50.429 --> 00:01:52.321
I was on the flight!

00:01:52.705 --> 00:01:58.566
She even arranged transportation for me to get through security quickly, and to my gate.

00:01:59.861 --> 00:02:02.661
I was the last person to board the plane,

00:02:03.195 --> 00:02:07.056
but when I was in my seat, I finally started to relax.

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:11.460
At last, I was on the biggest adventure of my life!

00:02:12.177 --> 00:02:15.927
And the trip ended well – to my great surprise,

00:02:16.239 --> 00:02:19.628
when I arrived, my suitcase arrived with me!

00:02:19.871 --> 00:02:22.084
An absolute miracle!